  "reasoning": {
    "objective": "Produce the normalized input vector for \"Agriculture Aquaculture Water Exchange Planning\" from current observations so RE can evaluate its CES sequences.",
    "systemPrompt": "You are the OpenClaw input-analyst agent for the RealityEngine machine \"Agriculture Aquaculture Water Exchange Planning\".\n\nOBJECTIVE\nReason over the currently available observations and produce a normalized assessment of the machine's input axes. Agriculture domain machine for aquaculture operations focused on water exchange planning. It monitors makeup water quality, salinity match, temperature match, and discharge limits and emits AI-dispatchable outputs at [92:96] for automation, maintenance, and optimization workflows.\n\nINPUT AXES (return one value in [0.0, 1.0] for each; anchors define the scale):\n- process_stability (index 0):  0.0 = unstable or outside safe operating band; | 0.5 = watch band; | 1.0 = stable in target band\n- resource_efficiency (index 1):  0.0 = wasteful or constrained; | 0.5 = acceptable; | 1.0 = efficient and available\n- biosecurity_or_ipm_status (index 2):  0.0 = active biological threat; | 0.5 = mitigated watch state; | 1.0 = controlled and documented\n- maintenance_readiness (index 3):  0.0 = overdue or faulted; | 0.5 = service due soon; | 1.0 = maintained and verified\n\nWHAT YOUR INPUTS TRIGGER (RE evaluates the CES deterministically; you assert your expectation, RE decides):\n- agx-010-urgent-stabilize (RED) -> action: dispatch-agent\n- agx-010-optimize-operation (GREEN) -> action: trigger-agent-workflow\n- agx-010-preventive-maintenance (GREEN) -> action: create-work-order\n- agx-010-operating-window-ok (GREEN) -> action: continue-monitoring",
    "outputContract": "Return one structured line per input axis as `<axis_key>: <0.0-1.0>`, then `asserted_sequence: <sequenceId>`, `confidence: <low|moderate|high|0-1>`, and `rationale: <one sentence>`. RE re-evaluates the CES from the written input vector and is authoritative for which sequence fires.",
    "inputAxes": [
      {
        "index": 0,
        "key": "process_stability",
        "anchors": {
          "low": "unstable or outside safe operating band;",
          "mid": "watch band;",
          "high": "stable in target band"
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "key": "resource_efficiency",
        "anchors": {
          "low": "wasteful or constrained;",
          "mid": "acceptable;",
          "high": "efficient and available"
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "key": "biosecurity_or_ipm_status",
        "anchors": {
          "low": "active biological threat;",
          "mid": "mitigated watch state;",
          "high": "controlled and documented"
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "key": "maintenance_readiness",
        "anchors": {
          "low": "overdue or faulted;",
          "mid": "service due soon;",
          "high": "maintained and verified"
        }
      }
    ],
    "sequenceCatalog": [
      {
        "sequenceId": "agx-010-urgent-stabilize",
        "label": "agx-010-urgent-stabilize",
        "rag": "RED",
        "outputIndex": 0,
        "action": "dispatch-agent"
      },
      {
        "sequenceId": "agx-010-optimize-operation",
        "label": "agx-010-optimize-operation",
        "rag": "GREEN",
